# @hub-lanes

# ── FLEET VERSION CHECK (BH-7191) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 10 min: compare the harness sha each box reports (box_status) with
# first-parent origin/main, and write one ALERTS line per box that lags main by
# more than harness_version.max_lag_min. Alert only, exit 0. Off: the
# lane-off-fleet-version-check switch or bin/harness-ctl.sh off fleet-version-check.
*/10 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/fleet-version-check.sh >> /root/harness/logs/fleet-version-check-cron.log 2>&1
